step_details.raw_response:
Thought: Test a simple best_single strategy with NaiveMovingAverage to see if a single strong seasonal model beats the full pool mean.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"best_single","model":"NaiveMovingAverage"}

Thought: Test a trimmed‑mean over all 19 models (pool_full) to see if robust averaging beats the current best single model.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"trimmed_mean","pool":"pool_full","trim_pct":0.2}

Thought: Test a robust median over the most consistent models (pool1) to see if it beats the current best single model.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool1"}

Thought: Test a single strong model FT_rf to see if it beats NaiveMovingAverage.

Action: evaluate_strategy
Action Input: {"combine":"best_single","model":"FT_rf"}

Thought: Test a median combination over pool2 to see if a robust middle‑value strategy improves on the current leader.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool2"}

Thought: Test a DTW barycenter over the small, stable pool1 to see if it outperforms the current leader.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool1","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: Test a median combination over pool3 to see if a robust middle‑value strategy improves on the current leader.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool3"}

Thought: Test a DTW barycenter over pool2 to see if a different aggregation improves on the leader.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool2","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: Test a weighted combination using inverse error weights on the most stable pool (pool3) to see if it improves over the current leader.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","models":["rf","CWT_rf","DWT_rf","FT_rf","FT_catboost","ONLY_CWT_rf"],"weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Test a simple mean over the more stable pool4 to see if a less robust but broader average improves over the current best single model.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"mean","pool":"pool4"}

Thought: Test a trimmed‑mean over pool4 to see if robust averaging of the most stable models improves on the current leader.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"trimmed_mean","pool":"pool4","trim_pct":0.2}

Thought: Test a median combination over pool4 to see if a robust central value improves on the current leader.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool4"}

